# FindAHome 🇰🇪

**Trusted Real Estate Platform for the Kenyan Market.**

FindAHome solves the "fake listing" problem in Kenya by creating a verified marketplace for rentals. We focus on transparency, providing critical details like water availability (borehole), internet (fiber), and commute distances.

## Tech Stack (Hybrid)
- **Backend**: Django + Django REST Framework (Python).
  - *Why?* Powerful Admin interface for manual verification of agents and listings.
- **Frontend**: Next.js (React) + Tailwind CSS.
  - *Why?* Fast, mobile-first experience for house hunters.
- **Database**: SQLite (Dev) / PostgreSQL (Prod).

## Key Features
- **🛡️ Verified Listings**: Every listing is manually verified to prevent scams.
- **💧 Utilities Transparency**: Explicit tags for "Borehole Water", "Council Water", and "Backup Power".
- **⚡ Fiber Ready**: Filter homes by internet provider availability (Safaricom/Zuku).
- **🚌 Commute Info**: "Distance to Main Road/Stage" for public transport users.
- **💬 Direct Connect**: One-click "Chat on WhatsApp" with verified agents.

## Project Structure
├── backend/ # Django Project
