### MVP KPI Targets (First 30 Days)
- Verified listing rate: 95%+ of published listings verified.
- Inquiry conversion: at least 8% of listing views result in inquiry action.
- Recommendation CTR: at least 12% CTR on recommended cards.
- Fraud resolution: 90% of flagged listings reviewed within 24 hours.
- Time to first inquiry: median less than 2 days after signup.

### Definition of Ready (Build Start Gate)
- RBAC matrix approved.
- API contracts approved.
- Legal policy drafts ready.
- Staging and CI configured.
- Priority county launch list approved.

